00:25:49.980 --> 00:26:00.120
m -5 -5 l 1925 -5 1925 1085 -5 1085

00:25:50.560 --> 00:25:53.270
Bukankah itu terlalu kuat?

00:25:51.400 --> 00:25:53.650
Qual sang 
Mahardika Pengurai.

00:25:52.730 --> 00:25:55.570
Sekarang coba kita praktikan.

00:25:53.820 --> 00:25:56.530
Kamu pikir sudah berapa 
lama kita bertualang?

00:25:54.190 --> 00:25:56.780
Kami telah bepergian bersama 
selama bertahun-tahun sekarang.

00:25:55.690 --> 00:25:57.820
Apa ada yang salah?

00:25:56.110 --> 00:25:57.950
Belajar juga penting.

